  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given system of equations has more than one solution, then it must have infinitely many solutions.</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mtable columnalign=\"right left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>a</mi></menclose></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>i</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>"
